      "side": 1,
      "message": "Small suggestion: this open-codes `vma_pte_add_slice()` with a raw `pte_val()` addition, and aosp/4367599 (`insert_page_into_pte_locked()`) and `remap_pfn_range_slice()` in aosp/4367597 add two more copies.\n\nIf an explicit slice is really needed, could `vma_pte_add_slice()` take the slice index instead of the address? That way the encoding stays in one place and goes through `pte_advance_phys()`.",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "15d0d072420a4b3a22d406864b4dff38aa64c7bf",
